Pixel Scan demo film — credits and licences

Everything in this film is drawn and synthesized in code in this folder: the pixel font (font.js),
the figure "Bit" (bit.js), the lab and scanner (lab.js), the chart, props and camera (main.js) and
the chiptune score (music.py, numpy synthesis). No samples, fonts, images or footage are used.

Rendered and mastered with Lemo-Opuscar's core tools (core/render: events, readcheck, video, mux),
MIT licence, github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar — used as tools, not copied into this folder.
The page imports nothing from the library; no library code is included here.
